{
  "stats": {
    "peak": 0.4423876448310903,
    "rms": 0.030732294761964925,
    "seconds": 64,
    "channels": 2,
    "sampleRate": 48000
  },
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "arcole",
      "start": 1.2,
      "end": 12.7,
      "text": "一七九六年，年轻的波拿巴在意大利成名。格罗把他画成举旗的英雄，传奇由此开场。",
      "duration": 9.209524,
      "file": "narration/00.wav",
      "voice": "Microsoft Huihui Desktop",
      "synthetic": true
    },
    {
      "id": "jaffa",
      "start": 16.1,
      "end": 27.8,
      "text": "三年后，东方远征遭遇瘟疫与挫折。雅法这幅画，却把他塑造成敢于靠近病人的领袖。",
      "duration": 9.167982,
      "file": "narration/01.wav",
      "voice": "Microsoft Huihui Desktop",
      "synthetic": true
    },
    {
      "id": "brumaire",
      "start": 28.4,
      "end": 34.6,
      "text": "回到法国，他发动雾月政变，成为第一执政。",
      "duration": 4.830748,
      "file": "narration/02.wav",
      "voice": "Microsoft Huihui Desktop",
      "synthetic": true
    },
    {
      "id": "alps",
      "start": 35.1,
      "end": 46.8,
      "text": "一八〇〇年，他翻越阿尔卑斯，再入意大利。现实中骑的是骡，大卫却让他驾驭昂首的白马。",
      "duration": 9.662268,
      "file": "narration/03.wav",
      "voice": "Microsoft Huihui Desktop",
      "synthetic": true
    },
    {
      "id": "coronation",
      "start": 51.1,
      "end": 62.7,
      "text": "一八〇四年，他成为皇帝，并为约瑟芬加冕。从军旗到皇冠，八年之间，名画也塑造了他的帝国传奇。",
      "duration": 11.198685,
      "file": "narration/04.wav",
      "voice": "Microsoft Huihui Desktop",
      "synthetic": true
    }
  ],
